  "question": {
    "text": "A radioactive element has a half life of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn></math> days. The percentage of original activity remaining after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>83</mn></math> days is____(Nearest integer)<br />(Given : antilog <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>333</mn></math>, antilog <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>93</mn></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For first order reaction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;...&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;...&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mn>83</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mn>200</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>",
